@title Save changes? is a question: it stays modal with no dock buttons (1366x768)
@area Windows
@sizes 1366x768
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
key q
wait 4
text circuit breaker
wait 6
click_text "Miniature circuit breaker, 3-pole" Button
wait 6
click 450 200
wait 6
key Escape
wait 10
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text close project
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
expect "Save changes?"
shot save-changes-modal
check_layout
